    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A single-player fart-stealth simulation where you complete silly beach tasks before the day ends \u2014 without getting caught.</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It\u2019s my last vacation day!! I have to make it PERFECT!! \ud83c\udf34\ud83d\udc96</strong><br><strong>But... uh-oh. My tummy\u2019s doing the <i>bubble dance</i>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>I might fart. Like, a lot.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But whatever~ I\u2019m cute,  demure, and obviously too pretty to blame! \ud83d\udc85\u2728</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note to self: never eat mystery sushi before a beach day.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One girl. Ten tasks. Infinite toots. \ud83c\udf34\ud83d\udca8\u2728</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 <strong>Fart</strong> <strong>strategically </strong>\u2014<strong>\u00a0</strong>Don\u2019t let them catch you\u2026 they're judging. Act pretty. Pretend nothing happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udece\ufe0f <strong>Time your farts with perfect distractions</strong> \u2014 bike bells, lifeguard whistles, *ka-ching!*s, or someone snoring in a tent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca8 <strong>Choose your moment wisely</strong> \u2014 loud or silent? Smelly or safe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udebb <strong>Keep an eye on your gas bar</strong> \u2014 let it fill too much and BOOM: surprise fart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca9 <strong>Visit the toilet before it\u2019s too late</strong> \u2014 Fart too much without a toilet break and uh-oh... poop risk increases.\u00a0Seriously, don\u2019t test it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf66 <strong>Complete your bucketlist</strong>\u00a0\u2014Stretch with beach yoga, bike past tourists, sunbathe, win headball and dance contests, pop balloons in the sea, chat by the campfire, flirt with cute boys, show off your bench press skills, and treat yourself to a cute little ice cream. Yes, all of that. While farting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Can you survive one sunny day on the beach... without blowing your cover \u2014 or your bikini?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643630/extras/deedd5702e2c6677a9393e6b9bcc6a6c.avif?t=1753093786\" width=600 height=918 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
